# Musa — Graph Engineering Loop

<!-- GraphForge live mirror. This mermaid block is the single source of truth.
     Node positions persist in `%% @pos id x y` comments. Edit by hand or by AI: -->

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    subgraph INTENT["1 · Intent and DAG design"]
        I1[User intent in natural language] --> I2[Decompose into DAG with typed nodes]
        I2 --> I3[Define gates, provenance and recovery paths]
    end
    subgraph GATES["2 · Validation gates"]
        V1{V1 · schema valid?} -->|fail| REC[Error recovery: retry or replan]
        V1 -->|pass| V2{V2 · tool contract honored?}
        V2 -->|fail| REC
        V2 -->|pass| V3{V3 · lint score 70+?}
        V3 -->|fail| REC
        V3 -->|pass| V4{V4 · visual QA clean?}
        V4 -->|fail| REC
        V4 -->|pass| OK[Approved artifact]
    end
    subgraph RUN["3 · Provenance and RunReport"]
        P1[Record provenance: inputs, tools, versions] --> P2[Terminal RunReport: status, artifacts, timings]
    end
    I3 --> V1
    REC -->|replan| I2
    OK --> P1
    P2 --> FB[Feedback hardens the playbook library]
    FB -.->|next run starts stronger| I2
```
